<title>USA: Sunrise Medical to buy Kid-Kart Inc.</title>
<headline>Sunrise Medical to buy Kid-Kart Inc.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunrise Medical Inc said it signed an agreement to buy Kid-Kart Inc, a manufacturer of pediatric positioning and dependent mobility products, based in Montana.</p>
<p>The price was not disclosed but Sunrise said Kid-Kart has annual revenues of about $5 million.</p>
</text>
